# TC-007: The same thermometer reading can conceal different stored energies
# Design only: predictions below are not measured observations.
register lv3
add v1 water 100g @ 0C
new
add v2 water 100g @ 0C
cool v1 5kJ
cool v2 20kJ
measure v1 thermometer
measure v2 thermometer
measure v1 calorimeter
measure v2 calorimeter
inspect
